                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c7646de-2292-30c2-aee6-d6705eaae7bd",
                                        "entry_id": "92c80ed3-d682-386d-a097-1ba0324fc135",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To plan; to expect; to think."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "dialectal",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22e5d7e1-44b3-421f-bc1c-c9bab9ae9309",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7646de-2292-30c2-aee6-d6705eaae7bd",
                                                "text": "I stumbled along through the young pines and huckleberry bushes. Pretty soon I struck into a sort of path that, I cal’lated, might lead to the road I was hunting for. It twisted and turned, and, the first thing I knew, made a sudden bend around a bunch of bayberry scrub and opened out into a big clear space like a lawn."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "296327ee-1914-3656-b226-787111328d5f",
                                        "entry_id": "92c80ed3-d682-386d-a097-1ba0324fc135",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To ascertain or predict by mathematical or astrological computations the time, circumstances, or other conditions of; to forecast or compute the character or consequences of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8141835f-332f-495f-af92-a8911c5e093e",
                                                "sense_id": "296327ee-1914-3656-b226-787111328d5f",
                                                "text": "to calculate or cast one’s nativity"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "778a7940-f076-40f0-8a86-4eeeecf9a2a0",
                                                "sense_id": "296327ee-1914-3656-b226-787111328d5f",
                                                "text": "A cunning man did calculate my birth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc30237d-4c85-3595-9b56-7a7821762945",
                                        "entry_id": "92c80ed3-d682-386d-a097-1ba0324fc135",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To adjust for purpose; to adapt by forethought or calculation; to fit or prepare by the adaptation of means to an end."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8124d9d-137f-469f-a5ac-0f90f807c385",
                                                "sense_id": "fc30237d-4c85-3595-9b56-7a7821762945",
                                                "text": "to calculate a system of laws for the government and protection of a free people"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1285d7d-37e2-424e-aad0-b0d3d83f7074",
                                                "sense_id": "fc30237d-4c85-3595-9b56-7a7821762945",
                                                "text": "[Religion] is […] calculated for our benefit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f9cfce6-0388-3df3-b493-b992cd69cafa",
                                        "entry_id": "92c80ed3-d682-386d-a097-1ba0324fc135",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To imagine sequences of potential moves and responses without actually moving the pieces."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
